WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:01.480
Guau.

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:03.280
What a touching story.

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:06.360
I might even shed a tear.

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:10.960
If you knew about this,

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:12.920
why didn't you tell her?

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.480
Because she's not like us, Dad.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.160
Gina was hoping for

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:19.440
 a Christmas miracle.

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:21.680
And I didn't want to be the one

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.160
to take away her hope.

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:27.600
You succeeded in that anyway.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.840
I'm sorry I can't attend

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:36.200
your Christmas dinner.

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:38.720
I need to be with my grand

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:41.400
with my mother.

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:43.120
And I need to think

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:45.440
about how to save her life.

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:50.280
Gina.

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.240
You've disappointed me, son,

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:57.440
truly so.
